e offering that you can do, like MLOA is doing, which seems at a high level to be increasing your profit per transaction while, at the same time, streamlining the user experience?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/06/zillow-group-inc-zg-q2-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ZG 2018 Q2","e":"zg","d":"2018-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Spencer Rascoff","x":"And we're very excited about the MLOA acquisition, which we think dramatically expands the TAM when combined with the Zillow Offers business, which is actually doing great despite the sort of weird appearance of reducing guidance because of the timing of revenue recognition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/06/zillow-group-inc-zg-q2-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ZG 2018 Q4","e":"zg","d":"2019-02-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Rich Barton","x":"We've seen this in travel, ride hailing, car buying, shopping, streaming video and more, and the time for real estate is now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/zillow-group-inc-zg-q4-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ZG 2018 Q4","e":"zg","d":"2019-02-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Rich Barton","x":"We allowed price to get pushed too hard with the auction-based model, and we miscalculated how important lead volume even the less transaction already nurture leads where to many of our PA's when we started more streaming and filtering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/zillow-group-inc-zg-q4-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ZG 2018 Q4","e":"zg","d":"2019-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rich Barton","x":"Well, for Zillow -- and ultimately -- both for Zillow and ultimately to streamline the transaction for many buyers, sellers and real estate professionals.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/zillow-group-inc-zg-q4-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ZG 2018 Q4","e":"zg","d":"2019-02-21","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Greg Schwartz","x":"…last year and even though many of our customers had significant profit in the models as cost structures in their lives and in their businesses that had assumes relatively stable levels of profits and they were disrupted by poor building that trust with them, that many Premier Agents coming back.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/zillow-group-inc-zg-q4-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ZG 2019 Q1","e":"zg","d":"2019-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Rich Barton","x":"In fact, in the second quarter we are planting seeds for Title and Escrow services tied to Zillow Offers, which is another fundamental yet fragmented piece of the transaction, we intend to streamline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/09/zillow-group-inc-zg-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"ZG 2019 Q2","e":"zg","d":"2019-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rich Barton","x":"We're in the early stages of a bold expansion from solely a residential real estate media company into the trillion-dollar TAM opportunity of streamlining and enabling the real estate transaction itself.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/zillow-group-a-shares-zg-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ZG 2019 Q2","e":"zg","d":"2019-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rich Barton","x":"As we transition from MLOA to Zillow home loans, we are building new proprietary technology to streamline and integrate home loans as our payments platform for Zillow Offers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/zillow-group-a-shares-zg-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ZG 2025 Q3","e":"zg","d":"2025-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Wacksman","x":"Second, we are modernizing the transaction experience for renters and property managers alike, streamlining how they connect and handle applications, leases, and payments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/zillow-group-zg-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZG 2025 Q3","e":"zg","d":"2025-10-30","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Wacksman","x":"So antitrust concerns aside, maybe your views on any potential disruption if agents choose or are forced to take their three-phase marketing program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/03/zillow-group-zg-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZG 2026 Q1","e":"zg","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Wacksman","x":"Before I give more detailed updates on what is driving our results in both for sale and rentals, I want to spend a moment on our company strategy and on how we are using AI to accelerate it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/zillow-zg-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZG 2026 Q1","e":"zg","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Wacksman","x":"Our long history of innovation and investment enables us to deliver value that only increases as AI capabilities grow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/zillow-zg-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZG 2026 Q1","e":"zg","d":"2026-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Wacksman","x":"For property managers using AI Assist, it is streamlining lead management, application screening, and lease coordination, reducing friction at every step of the transaction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/zillow-zg-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZG 2026 Q1","e":"zg","d":"2026-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Wacksman","x":"And our employees are using AI to reinvent and streamline their workflows.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/zillow-zg-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZG 2026 Q2","e":"zg","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Jeremy Wacksman","x":"Consumers who use AI Mode spend more than 3x as long on Zillow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/zillow-zg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZG 2026 Q2","e":"zg","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Hofmann","x":"We reported $36 million of restructuring costs in Q2 related to cost management actions we announced yesterday, that are also not included in EBITDA expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/zillow-zg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZG 2026 Q2","e":"zg","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Hofmann","x":"Yesterday, we announced a restructuring, which included eliminating approximately 7% of employees as we continue to scale our integrated strategy and drive efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/zillow-zg-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZG 2026 Q3","e":"zg","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Jeremy Wacksman","x":"With Zillow's transaction infrastructure, our agentic AI does more than guide the shopping experience people love.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/zillow-zg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZG 2026 Q3","e":"zg","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Jeremy Wacksman","x":"We are developing agentic AI inside Follow Up Boss, so agents can spend less time managing their pipelines and more time serving clients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/zillow-zg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ZG 2026 Q3","e":"zg","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeremy Hofmann","x":"Q3 EBITDA expenses were $542 million, up 6% year-over-year, and better than our expectations of $560 million to $565 million, driven by recent restructuring and overall cost management.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earni